{#- One footer everywhere — it is the site's densest block of links, which is
    exactly why it mattered that every one of them pointed into English.

    Before this, a visitor reading /es/servicios/branding/ reached a footer
    whose eighteen links all led to the English tree, under English headings.
    The header had already been given a per-locale route table for this reason;
    the footer, which carries three times as many links, had not. For a crawler
    that made the Spanish half a set of leaves with no internal edges: every
    page fed authority back into English and none into Spanish.

    Terms is the one deliberate exception. There is no /es/terminos/ because a
    machine-translated contract is worse than an English one, and translating
    it is the owner's call, not a build step. The link stays English and says
    so with hreflang. -#}
{%- set isEs = (L == "es") %}
{%- set fWork = "/es/trabajo/" if isEs else "/work/" %}
{%- set fLab = "/es/lab/" if isEs else "/lab/" %}
{%- set fServices = "/es/servicios/" if isEs else "/services/" %}
{%- set fStudio = "/es/estudio/" if isEs else "/studio/" %}
{%- set fNotes = "/es/notas/" if isEs else "/insights/" %}
{%- set fPrivacy = "/privacidad/" if isEs else "/privacy/" %}
  <footer class="footer" id="contact">
    <div class="container">
      {#- The finale (immersive-plan §11): the CTA fills with gold as you
          scroll toward it, over a ghost of the SAME phrase in the OTHER
          language — the one brand fact no competitor shares, used as the
          design device. i18n.js keeps the pair inverted on every swap via
          data-i18n-alt. Without JS the gold layer simply shows filled. -#}
      <div class="footer__cta reveal">
        <p class="footer__cta-label" data-i18n="footer.ctaLabel">{{ "Empezar un proyecto" if isEs else "Start a project" }}</p>
        <div class="footer__cta-stack">
          <span class="footer__cta-title footer__cta-title--ghost" aria-hidden="true" data-i18n-alt="footer.ctaTitle">{{ "Let's Talk" if isEs else "Hablemos" }}</span>
          <a href="/contact" class="footer__cta-title footer__cta-title--fill" data-i18n="footer.ctaTitle">{{ "Hablemos" if isEs else "Let's Talk" }}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__contact">
        <div class="footer__contact-item">
          <span class="footer__contact-label" data-i18n="footer.emailLabel">{{ "Nuevos Negocios" if isEs else "New Business" }}</span>
          <a href="mailto:hey@creativemk.net" class="footer__contact-value">hey@creativemk.net</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer__contact-item">
          <span class="footer__contact-label" data-i18n="footer.phoneLabel">{{ "Ruta de proyecto" if isEs else "Project Path" }}</span>
          <a href="/contact" class="footer__contact-value" data-i18n="footer.projectPath">{{ "Enviar brief" if isEs else "Send a brief" }}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__main">
        <div>
          <h2 class="footer__column-title" data-i18n="footer.navigation">{{ "Navegación" if isEs else "Navigation" }}</h2>
          <ul class="footer__nav-list">
            <li><a href="{{ fWork }}" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.work">{{ "Proyectos" if isEs else "Work" }}</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ fLab }}" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.lab">Lab</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ fServices }}" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.services">{{ "Servicios" if isEs else "Services" }}</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ fStudio }}" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.about">{{ "Nosotros" if isEs else "About" }}</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ fNotes }}" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.blog">Insights</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.contact">{{ "Contacto" if isEs else "Contact" }}</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="footer__column-title" data-i18n="footer.services">{{ "Servicios" if isEs else "Services" }}</h2>
          <ul class="footer__nav-list">
            {%- for service in services %}
            <li><a href="{{ fServices }}{{ service.esSlug if isEs else service.slug }}/" class="footer__nav-link">{{ service.es.title if isEs else service.en.title }}</a></li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="footer__column-title" data-i18n="footer.office">{{ "Oficina" if isEs else "Office" }}</h2>
          <div class="footer__offices">
            <div class="footer__office">
              <span class="footer__office-city">CREATIVE MK HQ</span>
              <span class="footer__office-address" data-i18n="footer.address">{{ ("Estudio digital-first<br>Disponible de forma remota" if isEs else "Digital-first agency<br>Available worldwide") | safe }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="footer__column-title" data-i18n="footer.stayUpdated">{{ "Mantente al día" if isEs else "Stay Updated" }}</h2>
          <div class="footer__newsletter">
            <p class="footer__newsletter-text" data-i18n="footer.newsletterText">{{ "Recibe notas ocasionales sobre branding, UX, sitios web, sistemas de crecimiento e IA práctica." if isEs else "Get occasional notes on branding, UX, websites, growth systems, and practical AI." }}</p>
            <form class="footer__newsletter-form" id="newsletter-form">
              <input type="email" class="footer__newsletter-input" placeholder="{{ "Tu email" if isEs else "Your email" }}" data-i18n-placeholder="footer.emailPlaceholder" required>
              <button type="submit" class="footer__newsletter-btn" data-i18n="footer.subscribe">{{ "Suscribirse" if isEs else "Subscribe" }}</button>
            </form>
            <p class="footer__newsletter-success" id="newsletter-success" hidden>&#10003; <span data-i18n="footer.subscribeSuccess">{{ "Gracias por suscribirte!" if isEs else "Thanks for subscribing!" }}</span></p>
            <div class="footer__social">
              <a href="/contact" class="footer__social-link" data-i18n="hero.primaryCta">{{ "Empezar un proyecto" if isEs else "Start a project" }}</a>
              <a href="mailto:hey@creativemk.net" class="footer__social-link">Email</a>
              <a href="{{ fServices }}" class="footer__social-link" data-i18n="nav.services">{{ "Servicios" if isEs else "Services" }}</a>
              <a href="{{ fNotes }}" class="footer__social-link" data-i18n="nav.blog">Insights</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__bottom">
        <p class="footer__copyright">&copy; 2026 CREATIVE MK. <span data-i18n="footer.rights">{{ "Todos los derechos reservados." if isEs else "All rights reserved." }}</span></p>
        <div class="footer__legal">
          <a href="{{ fPrivacy }}" class="footer__legal-link" data-i18n="footer.privacy">{{ "Aviso de privacidad" if isEs else "Privacy Notice" }}</a>
          {#- English-only, and honest about it: hreflang tells a browser and a
              crawler that this link leaves the reader's language. -#}
          <a href="/terms/" class="footer__legal-link"{% if isEs %} hreflang="en" lang="en"{% endif %} data-i18n="footer.terms">{{ "Términos de servicio" if isEs else "Service Terms" }}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
